cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "ML_AMR_Prediction_v2: A stability-filtered, biologically validated AMR k-mer Knowledge Base pipeline for Escherichia coli"
abstract: >-
  An alignment-free, out-of-core machine-learning pipeline that predicts
  antimicrobial resistance (AMR) in Escherichia coli from whole-genome
  assemblies using canonical 21-mer features and XGBoost, then reverse-translates
  the most important k-mers into biology via 5-seed feature stability, CARD/NCBI
  BLAST confidence tiering, resistant-versus-susceptible discriminativeness, and
  CARD variant-model SNP allele checks — building a queryable, confidence-tiered
  AMR k-mer knowledge base.
type: software
authors:
